{"date": "2020-04-12", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0412.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:13+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "95e8267ff6274cbdd6ddcbf274e5f655608c49ed4f0fd81a47df62ecd2ef4f64", "image_bytes": 192113, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Tue, 07 Apr 2020 15:26:03 GMT", "title": "宜共眠", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "唯有孤独恒常如新", "author": "伊丽莎白·毕肖普", "author_roles": ["诗人"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "一起醒来多么美妙，同一分钟醒来，听见，突然下起雨，落满屋顶。空气突然清冽，仿佛被空中一团黑线网，骤然通了电，多好。雨珠在屋顶四处咝咝作响，下方，一个个吻轻盈降临。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "ELIZABETH BISHOP"}
