{"date": "2020-04-25", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2020/0425.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:36:16+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "455344ada4af9190d69d394d4d0636129520a5b46df4d4293be325d58b6f20de", "image_bytes": 195461, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 20 Apr 2020 23:57:58 GMT", "title": "宜情窦初开", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "错误", "author": "郑愁予", "author_roles": ["诗人"], "ocr_confidence_min": 1, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "东风不来，三月的柳絮不飞，你的心如小小寂寞的城，恰若青石的街道向晚。跫音不响，三月的春帷不揭，你的心是小小的窗扉紧掩。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
